        "Spawn1": "Use Closed Holy Eye in the surface at night.\nThis world must first defeat Aelion, Primordial Star. Reusable; cannot summon during invasions or another boss.\nTime and biome are checked only when starting. Divine challenge deadlines do not apply.",
