        "Spawn2": "Use Shoreless Serpentskin in the underground or cavern layer.\nThis world must first defeat Ophir, All-Seeing Star. Reusable; cannot summon during invasions or another boss.\nTime and biome are checked only when starting. Divine challenge deadlines do not apply.",
